-    "\\end{equation*}\n",
-    "\n",
-    "Risk-neutral measure allows the option to be priced as the discounted value of its expected payoff $V(t)$ with the risk-free interest rate:\n",
-    "\n",
-    "\\begin{equation*}\n",
-    "V(t) = E[e^{-\\int_t^T r(u) \\,du}V(t) | S(t)]\n",
-    "\\label{eq:14} \\tag{14}\n",
-    "\\end{equation*}\n",
-    "\n",
